  <p id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0000" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">垣護之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0004" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">彥宗</persName>，略陽桓道人也。祖<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0015" ref="bdx_txf_e62">敞</persName>，仕苻氏，為長樂國郎中令。<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0029" ref="van_pwm_swv">慕容德</persName>入青州，以<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0037" ref="bdx_txf_e62">敞</persName>為車騎長史。<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0044" ref="van_pwm_swv">德</persName>兄子<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0047" ref="d86_d07_abd">超</persName>襲偽位，伯父<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0054" ref="av0_ly9_952">遵</persName>、父<persName id="c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001:m0057" ref="bdx_txf_e62_A">苗</persName>復見委任。</p>
</text>
